eam":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hg="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d4a5536-643c-4e14-bb13-9c0e5dee4775","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"buffer クラスの設計は結構難しいと思うので、まず std 外で実験してみるのが良さそうかなと思いました","ts":"1621686987.059900","thread_ts":"1621617361.056200","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VXt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89fe57d6-2c9a-4eda-98b0-e44a629c88b5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"好きなだけ import したり依存したりできるのが denops の利点なので","ts":"1621687005.060100","thread_ts":"1621617361.056200","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QRLi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"244e4927-a3af-46da-97f9-11fd0ed5404e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1621687032.060300","thread_ts":"1621617361.056200","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Muj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c355b16-282f-428d-9c68-53f50ebd3674","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしかに","ts":"1621687033.060500","thread_ts":"1621617361.056200","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xNAxh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20d2a792-5908-4f54-81bd-a1059fc7ab73","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そしたら、\u003chttp://fn.xxx|fn.xxx\u003e としてまずはbuffer関連の関数を追加する、という感じでいいですか？","ts":"1621687050.060700","thread_ts":"1621617361.056200","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P2q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36c850a4-af08-4c6b-a331-861e9bf68245","type":"message","user":"UML2DU3TK","text":"冗長ですが JS の場合、以下のように `this.constructor` から static にアクセスできますね。\n\n```class A {\n    static getName() {\n        return 'A'\n    }\n\n    getName() {\n        return this.constructor.getName()\n    }\n}```\nただ、TS の場合は、`this.constructor` の型が `Function` になってしまい、type error になるので、以下のようにより冗長な書き方でアクセスする事になりそう…。\n\n```class A {\n    static getName() {\n        return 'A'\n    }\n\n    getName() {\n        return (this.constructor as typeof A).getName()\n    }\n}```","ts":"1621688719.061200","thread_ts":"1621614657.054300","edited":{"user":"UML2DU3TK","ts":"1621689147.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8vLwr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92a7a75a-5126-4a6e-a68d-f955a623b35a","type":"message","user":"UML2DU3TK","text":"で、この様に書くくらいなら class から直接呼ぶほうがわかりやすいという…\nただ、汎用的ではないですね…\n```class A {\n    static getName() {\n        return 'A'\n    }\n\n    getName() {\n        return A.getName()\n    }\n}```","ts":"1621688840.061400","thread_ts":"1621614657.054300","edited":{"user":"UML2DU3TK","ts":"1621689563.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4=f28"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24c0c371-ac7e-47f4-a406-cbf89a1faa8f","type":"message","user":"UML2DU3TK","text":"となると、最悪のケースですが `@ts-ignore` を利用するしかないという\n```// @ts-ignore\nthis.constructor.getName()```\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/3841#issuecomment-646214218\u003e","ts":"1621689607.061800","thread_ts":"1621614657.054300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: T.constructor should be of type T · Issue #3841 · microsoft/TypeScript","id":1,"title":"T.constructor should be of type T · Issue #3841 · microsoft/TypeScript","title_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/3841#issuecomment-646214218","text":"Given class Example { } The current type of Example.constructor is Function, but I feel that it should be typeof Example instead. The use case for this is as follows: I\u0026amp;#39;d like to reference the ...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/3cb429e8b9070ab13586d00a4ad526f08ae726d0b6461379f517b6845f95e70b/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/3841","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/3841#issuecomment-646214218","original_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/3841#issuecomment-646214218"}],"parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ive"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f41bb41f-75f2-4b5d-9dae-e55396fc2e42","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1621689811.062100","thread_ts":"1621614657.054300","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qS9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46e8b12c-068b-4d52-96ed-43279ed8ee53","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; this.constructor\nこれは知らなかった…","ts":"1621689821.062300","thread_ts":"1621614657.054300","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D1ftl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75a193a1-fc49-4629-8c0c-613f7ba1b995","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"教えて頂いたことをメモっておきました\nありがとうございます\n\u003chttps://zenn.dev/skanehira/scraps/0dedc33ef245bd#comment-d538135f9689e7\u003e","ts":"1621689976.062500","thread_ts":"1621614657.054300","parent_user_id":"UDDCM376D","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4SziI"}]}]
